  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Bump astral-sh/setup-uv from 10.1.0 to 10.2.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/pull/2277\r\n* Show query state and timings while waiting by @rolandwalker in https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/pull/2278\r\n* Allow composing shell redirection with transforms by @rolandwalker in https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/pull/2279\r\n* Improve parsing around `$>` redirects by @rolandwalker in https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/pull/2280\r\n* Timed-out shell pipelines should report failure by @rolandwalker in https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/pull/2281\r\n* Prepare changelog for release v2.27.0 by @rolandwalker in https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/pull/2282\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/dbcli/mycli/compare/v2.26.0...v2.27.0",
